TITLE Transport exchange problem
SOLUTION 0
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
SOLUTION 1-10
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
SOLUTION 11
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
EXCHANGE_SPECIES
Na+ + X- = NaX
    log_k 0
Ca+2 + 2X- = CaX2
    log_k 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selout.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell NaX
    10 PUNCH SIM_NO, CELL_NO, MOL("NaX")
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -length 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -initial_time 0
    -print_cells 1-10
    -print_frequency 1
    -punch_cells 1-10
    -punch_frequency 1
    -warnings false